## Common Model Patterns

### Form Model Pattern
- Complex schema with nested objects
- Virtual properties for drafts
- Status enum for lifecycle
- Timestamps for tracking

### User Model Pattern
- Simple schema
- Virtual for computed properties
- Enum for language preference
- Soft delete with scheduled deletion

### Submission Model Pattern
- References to form
- Category enum for organization
- Mixed types for answers
- User agent tracking

### Team/Project Pattern
- Reference fields (not stored)
- Member count as virtual
- Owner flag for permissions
- Invite codes with expiration

